    "description": "Native SGLang Diffusion TP=2 on two H100 GPUs; matches the Cosmos3 T2I requests in vLLM nightly #18522. The vLLM deployment uses CFG=2, HSDP=2 and VAE patch=2; SGLang uses TP=2, CFG=1, SP=1 without FSDP.",
    "server_params": {
      "model": "nvidia/Cosmos3-Nano",
